  "description": "Song-U fled to the countryside to escape harassment from a senior colleague at work. One day, after spending a year holed up on a farm, he comes face-to-face with Do-Yeol, a young man brimming with primal instincts. Even Song-U, who would normally put up a wall against any man, finds his guard slipping in the presence of this man, who somehow feels more like a dog or a mammal… \n\n *\"That just now… wasn't an animal, was it a person…?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
